        "annotation_id": "49490242205f4c8c952c83f4918f5a6b_23",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "6. Having heard the submissions made at the Bar and after carefully going through the materials available in the record, it is pertinent to mention here that it is a settled principle of law, that at the time of framing of charge, the mater"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d42ae44a82b045289d7fa912ff2ee618_24",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is also settled principle of law that at the time of framing of charge, the court concerned, must only see whether there is any prima facie case against the accused and if the prima facie case exists, then the charges can be framed."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "eb03efbb7351428f901a6b6a2a56955a_25",
        "summary_section": "issue",
        "labels": [
          "ISSUE"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:issue"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "7. Now coming to the facts of the case, indisputably the person to whom the petitioner claims to have been given the house in question on rent was dead much before the alleged date of occurrence and the petitioner has not whispered a word a"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "043651198c6442d5a804673c8e3b165c_26",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": ", the petitioner do not dispute that he is the owner of the house."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "fa6dab327df8452f979f9ac6862efae1_28",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Under such circumstances, this court has no hesitation in holding that the defence put forth by the petitioner is not of such a nature as to absolve him of the entire allegations made against him."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "92e4916efa83491c97cc4b80fd0e7df3_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nHence, this Court is of the considered view that it being the settled principle of law that the defence of the petitioner is not to be considered, at the time of the framing of the charge there is no illegality in the order dated 04.01.202"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3c2ff00609574c1093a31a10f7f4a439_30",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Accordingly, this criminal miscellaneous petition being without any merit is dismissed."
      }
    ],
